# EnergyMech userfile example.
# Copy to data/mech.passwd, edit it, and chmod 600 data/mech.passwd.
# This placeholder deliberately contains no usable credentials.
#
# Example structure used by EnergyMech:
# user	owner
# mask	*!*@trusted.example
# chan	*
# opt	p0u100
# pass	REPLACE_WITH_A_STRONG_SECRET
